Grammar

    0 $accept: foo $end

    1 foo: `x`


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    error (256)
    `x` (258) 1


Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

    $accept (4)
        on left: 0
    foo (5)
        on left: 1
        on right: 0


State 0

    0 $accept: • foo $end

